    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "⟨u⟩",
      "rationale": "לארץ 只有定冠词“那地”，Bamanankan 需要物主代词“他们的”。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "ויהי",
      "rationale": "希伯来文“就有了”被并入 Bamanankan 的 kɛra，无独立词。"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "A y’a ta ⟨את⟩ a denkɛ fɔlɔ, min tun bɛna masakɛya a nɔ na, ka a wuli ka kɛ tasuma-saraka ye dɛngɛ kan; Yisrayɛl (Izrayɛl) kan kasa kpɛnɛ kɛra, u binna a la, ka yɛlɛm’ a taa ⟨u⟩ dugukolo la.",
